ular / día","guid":"B8htkbL3Sn6IQp1IjSnhsQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"168","parent":"0","text":"Perlas clínicas","guid":"RBkT86GeTsGulIORSHcZMQ","children":[{"id":"169","parent":"168","text":"\"La mejor vacuna es la que está en el brazo, no en la nevera\"","guid":"R3jjJ6fgQNm36smh4-xRPQ","children":[]},{"id":"170","parent":"168","text":"Vacunar en el box, no derivar al vacunatorio","guid":"TXnRO4-uRQmiAQvELxpHqA","children":[]},{"id":"171","parent":"168","text":"Co-administrar 4–5 vacunas en una visita es seguro y eficiente","guid":"TfuFiFqmRf2On8XANC49ig","children":[]},{"id":"172","parent":"168","text":"Influenza en cardiópata = estatina (no vacunar = subtratamiento)","guid":"XknQ_BLkSTmupEqEV357AQ","children":[]},{"id":"173","parent":"168","text":"El frágil responde menos pero se beneficia más (NNT bajo)","guid":"lSVL8-8mQ5K_oOjFXaN2nQ","children":[]},{"id":"174","parent":"168","text":"Shingrix puede reducir demencia Alzheimer ~20 %","guid":"2H4Du_5BStuh6DzcDLmfuA","children":[]},{"id":"175","parent":"168","text":"USD 1 invertido → USD 40 ahorrados al sistema","guid":"d3WTcSIMTLCPW5FpKyfUFQ","children":[]},{"id":"176","parent":"168","text":"Lenguaje no verbal: la cara del médico vende la vacuna","guid":"zCEVU753QeSNYo544Lqo0w","children":[]},{"id":"177","parent":"168","text":"Documentar estado vacunal al ingreso de UPC / UGA / ELEAM","guid":"Ldwcjqa2QEy3cUJag4aylA","children":[]},{"id":"178","parent":"168","text":"Antineumocócica antes del alta tras neumonía o sepsis","guid":"1CTOidsQQCWRy6h3khKlCw","children":[]}]},{"id":"179","parent":"0","text":"Acción en ELEAM Acalis Medina","guid":"u1fmyhSzSVe04GA6w-T-IQ","children":[{"id":"180","parent":"179","text":"Auditoría vacunal residentes","guid":"LaexG8NkQVmkb6wRA4MzOg","children":[]},{"id":"181","parent":"179","text":"Plan trimestral campañas internas","guid":"I6PpmWspTTiWPujRe-EpzA","children":[]},{"id":"182","parent":"179","text":"Convenio con vacunatorio o farmacia para compra volumen","guid":"BhG06bGDSaiSVsiO_EX7